ead of the beast"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l017","ordinal":271305,"en":"Made of fiber like a hut"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l018","ordinal":271306,"en":"Appearing in blue"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l019","ordinal":271307,"en":"Give cattle in abundance,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l020","ordinal":271308,"en":"Driving cattle saying \"I am God\""},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l021","ordinal":271309,"en":"Beating slavery, chewing fat,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l022","ordinal":271310,"en":"Cheering to the crowd,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l023","ordinal":271311,"en":"I can't get enough,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l024","ordinal":271312,"en":"Nine hundred red pomegranates"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l025","ordinal":271313,"en":"You are thick - he said"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l026","ordinal":271314,"en":"The wedding ceremony was bloody,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l027","ordinal":271315,"en":"The world heard his name"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l028","ordinal":271316,"en":"People were noisy and happy."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l029","ordinal":271317,"en":"Sprinkle black, give cattle,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l030","ordinal":271318,"en":"Father wanted and found"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l031","ordinal":271319,"en":"A person wants and finds a man."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l032","ordinal":271320,"en":"Desired Aichuruk"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l033","ordinal":271321,"en":"Dear letter"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l034","ordinal":271322,"en":"The nation is corrupt, the nation is dying,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l035","ordinal":271323,"en":"You are a dumbass"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l036","ordinal":271324,"en":"I have downloaded it,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l037","ordinal":271325,"en":"It's been many years since I received it."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l038","ordinal":271326,"en":"I did not leave the house"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b003:l039","ordinal":271327,"en":"It is the soul of what you did"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l001","ordinal":271328,"en":"I did not hear the child's voice"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l002","ordinal":271329,"en":"Honorable letter Aichüruk"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l003","ordinal":271330,"en":"I have never seen a child."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l004","ordinal":271331,"en":"Land along the river?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l005","ordinal":271332,"en":"As fate would have it, the day ends"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l006","ordinal":271333,"en":"Not the same son"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l007","ordinal":271334,"en":"Will I be like a fire extinguished?"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l008","ordinal":271335,"en":"Your father's grave, Kulchoro,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l009","ordinal":271336,"en":"If you do it in advance, order it"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l010","ordinal":271337,"en":"There is no heroic measure."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l011","ordinal":271338,"en":"If I close my eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l012","ordinal":271339,"en":"Esil that my father is dead,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l013","ordinal":271340,"en":"There is no crying child,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l014","ordinal":271341,"en":"You are so ugly, the world is shit!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l015","ordinal":271342,"en":"Returning from my wings,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l016","ordinal":271343,"en":"That's how I would die,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l017","ordinal":271344,"en":"Buurul lost his horse,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l018","ordinal":271345,"en":"I can't know if I want to,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l019","ordinal":271346,"en":"When the experts say it, don't listen."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l020","ordinal":271347,"en":"A blow to the forehead"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l021","ordinal":271348,"en":"I went to see it"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l022","ordinal":271349,"en":"As fate would have it, the day ended,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l023","ordinal":271350,"en":"I was going to die.\""},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l024","ordinal":271351,"en":"Darkened by darkness,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l025","ordinal":271352,"en":"Semetey was sad,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l026","ordinal":271353,"en":"The sun did not distract,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l027","ordinal":271354,"en":"Again, your mother is Kanikei"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l028","ordinal":271355,"en":"A great prophecy"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l029","ordinal":271356,"en":"He did not see a sign from the dome."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l030","ordinal":271357,"en":"Kind regards with a smile"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l031","ordinal":271358,"en":"Sighing and burning"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l032","ordinal":271359,"en":"Heartbroken from laughter,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p1100:b004:l033","ordinal":271360,"en":"Your hero walks like a lion"}]
